    "limitations": [
      "Only a partial parameter projection into the unchanged synthetic roster engine. These rows are not implemented official robot classes or faithful playable roles.",
      "Only max_hp and explicitly listed infantry base 17 mm heat parameters are sourced. Every other engine input must be an explicitly supplied synthetic assumption.",
